{"ticker":"MU","updated":"2026-11-14T01:15:37Z","profile":{"longName":"Micron Technology, Inc.","shortName":"Micron Technology, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"United States","website":"https://www.micron.com","fullTimeEmployees":61000,"marketCap":880597991424,"trailingPE":10.471007,"forwardPE":3.7461889,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.6116915,"pegRatio":0.16,"targetMeanPrice":1561.9111,"targetHighPrice":3000.0,"targetLowPrice":361.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":45,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":3.793,"earningsGrowth":10.595,"grossMargins":0.80716,"operatingMargins":0.74586,"profitMargins":0.63796,"totalRevenue":133188001792,"beta":2.398,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1255.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":192.59,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.08},"summary":"Micron Technology, Inc. engages in the provision of semiconductor memory and storage products in the United States, Taiwan, Mainland China, other Asia Pacific countries, Japan, Europe, and internationally. It operates through Cloud Memory Business Unit, Core Data Center Business Unit, Mobile and Client Business Unit, and Automotive and Embedded Business Unit segments. The company provides dynamic random access memory (DRAM) products, including High-Bandwidth Memory, doublie data rate, low-power DRAM, and graphics DRAM products; NAND products comprising solid state drives, managed NAND, and multi-chip packages; and NOR products. The company sells its products under the Micron brand name and private labels through its own direct sales force, sales or representative offices, as well as through distributors, retailers, and independent sales representatives. Micron Technology, Inc. was founded in 1978 and is headquartered in Boise, Idaho.","summary_zh":"美光科技公司在美國、台灣、中國大陸、其他亞太國家、日本、歐洲和國際上提供半導體記憶體和儲存產品。該公司透過雲端儲存業務部、核心資料中心業務部、行動和客戶端業務部以及汽車和嵌入式業務部等部門進行營運。本公司提供動態隨機存取記憶體（DRAM）產品，包括高頻寬記憶體、雙倍資料速率、低功耗DRAM和圖形DRAM產品； NAND 產品，包括固態硬碟、託管 NAND 和多晶片封裝；和 NOR 產品。該公司透過自